MID_MV30_02: <SH>
MID_MV30_02_m001: (roaring)
MID_MV30_02_m002: Concedimi questo onore.
MID_MV30_02_m003: (exerts of effort)
MID_MV30_02_m004: (pained/struggling roar)
MID_MV30_02_m005: (exerts of effort)
MID_MV30_02_m006: (pained/struggling roars)
MID_MV30_02_m007: Verrai soppresso dal peso\ndella tua mera esistenza!
MID_MV30_02_m008: Via libera. È il tuo momento!
MID_MV30_02_m009: (breath exert)
MID_MV30_02_m010: (determined exert)
MID_MV30_02_m011: (running, leaping, and attack exerts)
MID_MV30_02_m012: (big exert of effort)
MID_MV30_02_m013: (big exert of effort)
MID_MV30_02_m014: (pained roar)
MID_MV30_02_m015: (pained sound as he collapses)
MID_MV30_02_m016: (panting)